@startuml
!include common.iuml
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #eaf1fb
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #1f3b63
skinparam ActivityFontSize 14
title Flow Diagram 1: Indexing Path (run by the operator)
start
:Operator runs **pnpm run scrape**;
:Crawl college website\n(same origin, breadth-first, up to 600 pages);
:Extract text from HTML pages\n(main content only) and from PDFs;
:Save corpus to scraped.json;
:Operator runs **pnpm run timetables**;
:Scrape timetable portal: one document\nper class and one per faculty member;
:Operator runs **pnpm run ingest**;
:Split documents into 1500-character chunks\n(200 characters overlap);
repeat
  :Embed 5 chunks with Voyage AI (document mode);
  :Upsert vectors + metadata into Pinecone;
  :Write checkpoint, wait 21 s (rate limit);
repeat while (more chunks?) is (yes) not (no)
:Knowledge base ready (2,247 chunks);
stop
@enduml
